<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-jinshu" book-id="b-jinshu-054" chapter-id="c-jinshu-054-lu-dan" source-id="s-jinshu-054-lu-dan-ws2605147">
  <p id="c-jinshu-054-lu-dan:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-054-lu-dan:p001:m0000" ref="40p_eb9_ggr_D">雲</persName>弟<persName id="c-jinshu-054-lu-dan:p001:m0002" ref="2lr_p1t_rkm">耽</persName>為平東祭酒，亦有清譽，與<persName id="c-jinshu-054-lu-dan:p001:m0015" ref="40p_eb9_ggr_D">雲</persName>同遇害。大將軍參軍<persName id="c-jinshu-054-lu-dan:p001:m0025" ref="jjg_z4m_on6">孫惠</persName>與淮南內史<persName id="c-jinshu-054-lu-dan:p001:m0032" ref="oed_j2l_esr">硃誕</persName>書曰：「不意三陸相攜暗朝，一旦湮滅，道業淪喪，痛酷之深，荼毒難言。國喪俊望，悲豈一人！」其為州裏所痛悼如此。後<persName id="c-jinshu-054-lu-dan:p001:m0089" ref="9o2_vhv_r7y">東海王越</persName>討<persName id="c-jinshu-054-lu-dan:p001:m0094" ref="x4m_ygm_1d3">穎</persName>，移檄天下，亦以<persName id="c-jinshu-054-lu-dan:p001:m0103" ref="69h_uhy_hta">機</persName>、<persName id="c-jinshu-054-lu-dan:p001:m0105" ref="40p_eb9_ggr_D">雲</persName>兄弟枉害罪狀<persName id="c-jinshu-054-lu-dan:p001:m0112" ref="x4m_ygm_1d3">穎</persName><persName id="c-jinshu-054-lu-dan:p001:m0113" ref="40p_eb9_ggr_D">雲</persName>。</p>
</text>
